cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VeriWeave Govern or GovernBench in research, please cite this software."
title: "VeriWeave Govern"
type: software
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vtavakkoli/veriweave-govern"
url: "https://github.com/vtavakkoli/veriweave-govern"
abstract: >-
  Deterministic runtime governance and evidence-control software for enterprise
  AI agents, with human-review routing, tamper-evident audit, GovernBench
  scientific evaluation, EU/Austria regulation-grounded validation,
  independently executable OPA/Cedar/Ollama publication baselines, calibrated
  evidence research, adversarial testing, temporal replay, and counterfactual
  governance certificates.
authors:
